  "broken": [],
  "html": "<h1>Raw Confluence Storage</h1>\n<p>A pasted status macro passes straight through:</p>\n<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"status\" ac:schema-version=\"1\">\n<ac:parameter ac:name=\"colour\">Green</ac:parameter>\n<ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Done</ac:parameter>\n</ac:structured-macro>\n<p>A layout whose cells contain markdown that still gets converted:</p>\n<ac:layout>\n<ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_equal\">\n<ac:layout-cell>\n<p>Left column with <strong>bold</strong> and a <a href=\"https://example.net\">link</a>.</p>\n</ac:layout-cell>\n<ac:layout-cell>\n<p>Right column with a list:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>one</li>\n<li>two</li>\n</ul>\n</ac:layout-cell>\n</ac:layout-section>\n</ac:layout>\n<p>A raw table passes through with every attribute, including a blank line inside it. A cell body set off by blank lines is Markdown; one tight against its tags stays literal:</p>\n<table data-layout=\"center\" data-table-width=\"900\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 300px;\" />\n<col style=\"width: 600px;\" />\n</colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">\n<p>Q3 <strong>results</strong></p>\n</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" data-highlight-colour=\"#e3fcef\">\n<p><strong>auth</strong> is <a href=\"https://example.net\">up</a></p>\n</td>\n<td><p style=\"text-align: right;\">tight **not markdown**</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>99.8%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Storage format inside a code fence stays literal:</p>\n<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\"/>]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>",
  "warnings": [],
  "mentions": []
}
